  /// GB), 3072 (3 GB), 4096 (4 GB), 5120 (5 GB), 6144 (6 GB), 7168 (7 GB),
  /// 8192 (8 GB) - Available cpu values: 1024 (1 vCPU) Between 4096 (4 GB)
  /// and 16384 (16 GB) in increments of 1024 (1 GB) - Available cpu values:
  /// 2048 (2 vCPU) Between 8192 (8 GB) and 30720 (30 GB) in increments of
  /// 1024 (1 GB) - Available cpu values: 4096 (4 vCPU) Between 16 GB and 60
  /// GB in 4 GB increments - Available cpu values: 8192 (8 vCPU) This option
